// Mana Grafting (docs/DECKS.md section 3.1; 10.4: a node is grafted once, for good, no cooldown): a
// spell for an arcane unit on a mana node in its owner's borders. The node becomes the type of
// another node its owner has; a node grafted once cannot be grafted again (Plot::grafted).
