    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_MANA_GRAFTING_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Arcane units can cast Graft on a mana node in your borders: the node becomes the type of another node you have.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]A node is grafted once: it cannot be grafted again.",
